# Development scratch. `benchmark.Rmd` is a maintained document that README.md
# and TASKS.md both point at, so it is kept; the rest is not part of the package.
# In particular `_dev/Reproduce/` is Linero's JASA replication package -- seven
# third-party GPL-2 packages -- which is here as a reference and is not ours to
# redistribute, and `benchmark.html` is regenerable output.
_dev/*
!_dev/benchmark.Rmd
